        "2"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": null,
      "speaker_hint_basis": "unresolved",
      "EN": "Thanks! You got my partner out of there! Here, take this - it's from the bottom of my heart.",
      "JA_current": "有り難う！ あんたは相棒を救出してくれた！ ほら、これを持って行け。これは心底感謝の印だ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_darkvalley:val_escort_nap1_dialog_21#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "31",
      "text_id": "val_escort_nap1_dialog_31",
      "next": [
        "219"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "action",
          "value": "dialogs_darkvalley.val_escort_reward"
        },
        {
          "type": "give_info",
          "value": "val_escort_got_reward"
        }
      ],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "3"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": null,
      "speaker_hint_basis": "unresolved",
      "EN": "So, friend... What's going to happen with me now?.. Thanks. At least you tried to help. And I do keep my word.",
      "JA_current": "さて友人よ… 一体俺に何が起こってる…？ 有り難う、少なくともお前は助けようとしてくれた。俺も約束は守るよ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_darkvalley:val_escort_nap1_dialog_31#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "41",
      "text_id": "val_escort_nap1_dialog_41",
